nsform=\"translate(1036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2092.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(220,408.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,85.9)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1378,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1656,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2545,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"3309\" height=\"42.4\" x=\"853\" y=\"843.5\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(1260.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(460,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"3143\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Here's how we calculate it for a magnesium ion:</p>\n\n<p><p><strong>Atomic Mass (A)</strong>: 24</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>Mass of a Nucleon</strong>: <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.083ex\" height=\"2.02ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.1 5340.7 893.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=